     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Fixed in trunk.  Fix was to omit the label, as it is never read from this table.  The same was true for ownerId, so that was omitted from the table as well.  The main change was to DefaultDOManager.  See changeset at ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
