     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Just discovered this by accident. I am not sure if this is a known",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "problem or not. In Fedora 3.3 If a label ends in a \\ (blackslash) the",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "ingest of an object fails with an SQL error.",
       "type": "text"
      }
